                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Kazuhiko Aikawa has recently transferred to Mizuho High School. When asking a teacher why there was no boys' basketball team he was told that they were not a functing team and that they were about to be disbanded. Aikawa then declared that he was to be the fifth member of the team so that they could attempt the championship.",
